    "bbox": [
      62.73,
      364.69,
      522.93,
      375.76
    ],
    "text": "NATIONAL AQUACULTURE DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY OF SRI LANKA ACT, No. 53 OF 1998",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      388.69,
      538.01,
      411.76
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Development under Section 37 of NationalAquaculture Development Authority of Sri Lanka, Act No. 53 of 1998.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      293.61,
      424.69,
      537.92,
      447.76
    ],
    "text": "MAHINDA AMARAWEERA (M.P.),Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Development.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      472.69,
      114.44,
      495.76
    ],
    "text": "Colombo,26th July, 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      265.89,
      508.69,
      319.89,
      519.76
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      532.69,
      537.88,
      555.76
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as culture of Coral Species on artificial substrates for export regulationsNo. 01 of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      568.69,
      537.89,
      591.76
    ],
    "text": "2. These regulations shall permit the import of coral species which are not reported to be present in Sri Lankawaters.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      604.69,
      537.93,
      651.76
    ],
    "text": "3. Every permit to import any species of corals which are listed in the convention on International Trade inEndangered species of Wild Fauna and Flora (CITES) shall be obtained from Department of Wild Life Conservation andin respect of other species a license shall be issued by the Department of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources under Section39 of the Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Act as specified in Schedule II hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      664.69,
      537.89,
      687.76
    ],
    "text": "4. An application for a license to culture coral species on artificial substrates for export shall be made accordingto the prescribed from specified in the Schedule I hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.37,
      543.87,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2017'08'14PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 14.08.20172A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      100.93,
      547.2,
      124.0
    ],
    "text": "5. Any part of live organism or any part of artificial substrate shall not be discharged to the sea or environmentsurrounding the sea and all farming activities carried out shall be operated inside a building.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      136.93,
      547.19,
      160.0
    ],
    "text": "6. Culturing process shall be operated in an enterprise situated ten (10) Kilometers inside the country frommean sea level and discharge of waste water shall be as follows :\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      98.95,
      172.93,
      547.22,
      184.0
    ],
    "text": "(i) Waste water discharged from an enterprise situated near the beach shall not be discharged directly to the",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      184.93,
      547.25,
      208.0
    ],
    "text": "sea and this water shall be collected to a sedimentation tank and shall be sedimentated by using chlorineconcentration recommended by the Authority and shall be discharged by soaking into the sand of the beach.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      95.95,
      220.93,
      547.18,
      232.0
    ],
    "text": "(ii) Discharging of waste water from an enterprise situated outside the beach shall be sedimentated by using",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      115.15,
      232.93,
      350.99,
      244.0
    ],
    "text": "chlorine and shall be stored without soaking into the soil.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.15,
      256.93,
      486.63,
      268.0
    ],
    "text": "7. The waste water and sedimentated ingredients shall be discharged through sedimentation tank.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      280.93,
      547.23,
      316.0
    ],
    "text": "8. The artificial substrates used for coral farming shall be prepared according to the standards approved by theAuthority specified in Schedule III of these regulations and any other substrate or natural substrate obtained from SriLanka waters shall not be used.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      328.93,
      547.2,
      352.0
    ],
    "text": "9. The substrates shall be embossed with the seal of the Authority and the Department of Fisheries and AquaticResources together with the serial number issued by the Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      364.93,
      547.19,
      388.0
    ],
    "text": "10. No person shall transport and culture artificial substrates with coral species in Sri Lanka except under alicense issued by the Director General of the Authority or an officer authorized by him.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      400.93,
      547.11,
      436.0
    ],
    "text": "11. Every request for an aquaculture license specified in regulation 4 shall be made substantially in the formspecified in Schedule I hereto and every license to be issued under regulation 4 shall be made substantially in the formspecified in Schedule II hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      448.93,
      547.25,
      508.0
    ],
    "text": "12. Any applicant who requires license for farming of corals prior to obtaining such license shall obtainrecommendations of all the institutions proposed by the Authority and shall observe such recommendations together withthe recommendations of Technical Committee appointed by the Director General of the Authority according to theAquaculture Management Regulations 2011, made under the National Aquaculture Development Authority of Sri LankaAct, No. 53 of 1998 and published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 1736/21 dated December 13, 2011.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      520.93,
      547.19,
      544.0
    ],
    "text": "13. Every imported farmed coral shall be inspected by a mobile extension inspection committee appointed bythe Director General of the Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      556.93,
      547.17,
      580.0
    ],
    "text": "14. Importing and farming of coral species shall be carried out without any contravention of any provisions of theFauna and Flora Protection Ordinance (Chapter 469).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      91.15,
      592.93,
      190.16,
      604.0
    ],
    "text": "15. In these regulations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      127.15,
      616.93,
      547.23,
      628.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201cCulturing of Coral species on artificial substrates\u201d means culturing of imported Coral species or next",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      151.15,
      628.93,
      547.3,
      640.0
    ],
    "text": "generations of Corals on prepared substrates in any culture method in a centre away from sea area.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      127.15,
      652.93,
      547.37,
      664.0
    ],
    "text": "\u201cAuthority\u201d means National Aquaculture Development Authority established under Section 2 of National",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
