  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      260.85,
      100.93,
      326.85,
      112.0
    ],
    "text": "SCHEDULE III",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      141.45,
      124.93,
      446.24,
      136.0
    ],
    "text": "Standards approved by National Aquaculture Development Authority",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      148.93,
      453.51,
      160.0
    ],
    "text": "(1) When preparing substrates for aquatic animals ceramic, tile clay or fiber should be used.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      172.93,
      539.86,
      184.0
    ],
    "text": "(2) The substrate for live rock culture shall be embossed with the seal of NAQDA/DFAR and with the serial number",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      89.85,
      184.93,
      333.45,
      196.0
    ],
    "text": "issued by the National Aquaculture Development Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      208.93,
      501.02,
      220.0
    ],
    "text": "(3) The serial numbers shall consist of six numbers and all the numbers shall be placed on the live rock.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      232.93,
      540.01,
      244.0
    ],
    "text": "(4) A sample of the live rock to be used shall be shown to the National Aquaculture Development Authority and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      89.85,
      244.93,
      189.46,
      256.0
    ],
    "text": "shall obtain its approval.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      71.25,
      268.93,
      539.86,
      280.0
    ],
    "text": "(5) The substrates with same serial number shall not be culutured and substrates with serial number shall be deposited",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      89.85,
      280.93,
      443.26,
      292.0
    ],
    "text": "to ascending order. A serial number issued for any site shall not be used for other site.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      304.93,
      87.45,
      316.0
    ],
    "text": "08-977/1",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      376.93,
      126.46,
      388.0
    ],
    "text": "L. D. B. 1/2012(II)",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      55.05,
      400.93,
      532.68,
      412.0
    ],
    "text": "NATIONAL AQUACULTURE DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY OF SRI LANKA ACT, NO. 53 OF 1998",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      424.93,
      539.9,
      448.0
    ],
    "text": "Regulations made by the Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Development under Section 37 of NationalAquaculture Development Authority of Sri Lanka Act, No. 53 of 1998.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      295.65,
      460.93,
      539.84,
      484.0
    ],
    "text": "MAHINDA AMARAWEERA (M.P.),Minister of Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Development.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      496.93,
      114.44,
      520.0
    ],
    "text": "Colombo,26th July, 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      266.85,
      532.93,
      320.85,
      544.0
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      556.93,
      539.89,
      580.0
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as collecting, holding and supplying of brooder shrimps in order to breedbrackishwater shrimps (Penaeus species) regulations No. 2 of 2017.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      592.93,
      539.9,
      616.0
    ],
    "text": "2. No person shall maintain a center for collecting, holding and supplying of brooder shrimps unless such centerhas obtained a license issued under Section 39 of the Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      628.93,
      539.87,
      652.0
    ],
    "text": "3. All the centres for collecting, holding and supplying of brooder shrimps shall be established in close proximityto the beach enabling to transport brooder shrimps from sea within a short period.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      664.93,
      539.85,
      688.0
    ],
    "text": "4. All centres for collecting, holding and supplying of brooder shrimps shall be operated in accordance with thestandard of transporting brooder shrimps of the Authority specified in annexure I.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      700.93,
      539.92,
      724.0
    ],
    "text": "5. The brooder shrimps shall be collected from the sea areas specified by the Authority in the AquacultureManagement License.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.37,
      543.87,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2017'08'14PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 14.08.20176A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      100.93,
      547.17,
      124.0
    ],
    "text": "6. The minimum length of the cephalothorax of the female and male brooder shrimps selected for breeding shallnot be less than 55 mm and 45 mm respectively.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      136.93,
      547.14,
      160.0
    ],
    "text": "7. At the time of receiving brooder shrimps from the sea and selecting brooder shrimp, separate gloves, nets,utensils and other equipment shall be used separately for each brooder shrimp.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      172.93,
      547.29,
      196.0
    ],
    "text": "8. No person shall keep the brooder shrimps at the time of holding such brooder shrimps at such holding facilitydirectly open to the sun rays.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      208.93,
      547.2,
      232.0
    ],
    "text": "9. Every authorized centre for collecting brooder shrimps shall have sufficient separate jars, separate waterconnections and air connections in order to store brooder stock until the time of supply to the hatchery.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      244.93,
      547.16,
      268.0
    ],
    "text": "10. The antennos, eye stalk, rostreams, pleopods and walking legs of the brooder stock of collecting centresshall not be blurred or red.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      280.93,
      547.17,
      304.0
    ],
    "text": "11. Any person in charge of the centre for collecting brooder shrimps shall not keep in such centre any deadbrooder shrimps or brooder shrimps affected with white spot disease.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      316.93,
      547.24,
      340.0
    ],
    "text": "12. The tanks, jars, hand nets and other equipment used for collecting of brooder shrimps shall be disinfectedusing chlorine and shall be dried in the afternoon.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      352.93,
      547.22,
      376.0
    ],
    "text": "13. No person shall keep brooder shrimps in the center for collecting brooder shrimps for more than twenty four(24) hours and shall feed with cleaned squids. No person shall use Crustesia as a food at any time.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      388.93,
      547.15,
      412.0
    ],
    "text": "14. No person shall dump into the sea any brooder shrimp at the time of removal and such excess shrimp shall bedestroyed. Any excess brooder shrimps shall not be stored in the centre for collecting brooder shrimps.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      424.93,
      547.36,
      460.0
    ],
    "text": "15. Records shall be kept on matters such as the area of collection of brooder shrimps, the date of collection ofbrooder shrimps, the name and address of the collector, the number of brooder shrimps collected, the date of transportationto the hatchery and the hatchery issuing the brooder shrimps.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      472.93,
      547.2,
      508.0
    ],
    "text": "16. Any person in charge of transportation of brooder shrimps, at the time of preparation of brooder shrimps fortransport shall not damage or stress such shrimps. No person shall feed any brooder shrimp twenty four hours beforetransportation.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      520.93,
      547.3,
      556.0
    ],
    "text": "17. Any person in charge of the centre for collecting of brooder shrimps shall store such shrimps in a separatecontainer. The containers shall be in accordance with the standards recommended by the Authority as specified in annexureI hereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      568.93,
      547.17,
      592.0
    ],
    "text": "18. The water in the containers shall be at optimum level, such as temperature level at (20-250C). Ammoniaconcentration at (< 0:1 ppm) and oxygen concentration at (>4ppt).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.800000190734863,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      604.93,
      547.21,
      640.0
    ],
    "text": "19. When supplying brooder shrimps to the hatchery owner, the details such as catching area of brooder shrimps,particulars of supplier and date shall be submitted to the hatchery owner according to the specimen issued by the Authorityas specified in annexure 2 hereof",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      652.93,
      547.14,
      676.0
    ],
    "text": "20. Any owner of a centre for collecting brooder shrimps shall follow the best management practices introducedby the Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      688.93,
      547.32,
      724.0
    ],
    "text": "21. The Director General, an Inspector or any officer authorized in that behalf by the Director General shall havethe power to visit any centre of collecting brooder shrimps so as to verify that such enterprise has complied with all therequirements, stipulated and imposed under these regulations and to obtain samples and to receive reports and documents.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      50.13,
      71.17,
      537.81,
      94.38
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2017'08'14PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA 14.08.20177A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.300000190734863,
      9.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      100.93,
      180.45,
      112.0
    ],
    "text": "22. In these regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 6,
    "bbox": [
